OL,3,GNEWSATeens cleared of attempted murder
OL,4,Ain playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers held after an attack
OL,7,Fleft a man unable to use his right hand
OL,8,Fhave been cleared of attempted murder.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police said a man in his
OL,11,F30s was airlifted to hospital following
OL,12,Fa stabbing at Harwoods Recreation
OL,13,FGround in Watford on 12 October. He
OL,14,Fremained in hospital for five weeks.
OL,16,FAt St Albans Crown Court on 4
OL,17,FSeptember, the five 17 and 18-year-olds
OL,18,Fwere found not guilty of attempted
OL,19,Fmurder but convicted of various other
OL,20,Foffences, including grievous bodily
OL,21,Fharm (GBH), perverting the course of
OL,22,Fjustice, and supplying drugs.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
